        "score": 0.85,
        "tier": "intrinsics_extrinsics_unvalidated",
        "notes": "Each WorldCode sample ships camera_calibration per camera (e.g. lf_chest_fisheye, ldr_hand_fisheye): 3x3 intrinsic, distortion parameters, width, height, camera_model=fisheye; per-frame chest_0_poses give each camera's pose in the chest frame (extrinsics) and ego_poses the camera trajectory relative to frame 0. Paper reports a mocap-room test with mean positional error below 5 mm for the pose pipeline, but no calibration-specific validation (reprojection/epipolar error) is published. Source: HuggingFace card + arXiv:2512.24310.",
